			title: "Reach"
			description: ["Get an Iron Sword and hit something with it.", "", "Better Combat replaces the vanilla swing. Every weapon now has a real", "arc and reach -- a sword sweeps 120 degrees out to 2.5 blocks -- and each", "click steps to the next attack in that weapon's moveset.", "Hold the attack button to keep the combo running."]
