			y: 0.0d
			id: "F05A0F0A057AD70B"
			title: "Learn The Classes"
			description: ["Craft an Iron Longsword, an Iron Spear and an Iron Dagger.", "", "BetterWeapons is the pack's answer to flat sprite weapons -- every model", "is real geometry, and every one registers its own Better Combat moveset.", "Longsword sweeps wide. Spear thrusts long and thin. Dagger is fast and", "short. Swing all three at the same mob and the difference is obvious."]
