			description: ["Craft a Wooden Spear and a Wooden Battlestaff.", "", "Both cost sticks and planks. The spear outranges anything you can make", "on day one, and the battlestaff sweeps a full circle -- which matters", "more than damage when three drowned come over the gunwale at once."]
